Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:34:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix: make QML grammar optional

tree-sitter-qmljs ships no prebuilt binaries, so npm ci needs a native
toolchain on platforms without one (native Windows, linux-arm64). Move it to
optionalDependencies and cache its load: a failed load warns once and QML
files fall back to text chunks while every other language keeps its AST.
An ambient module declaration keeps typecheck and build working when npm
omitted the package entirely.
